# Billing UX (OPD + IP)

Billing owns **financial transactions**: charges and charge lines, packages, pricing, advances, payments, refunds, receipts, invoices, financial clearance, charge completeness, reconciliation, financial summaries.

**Source of truth:** Billing `OpdBill` / Auth `OpdBillService` — not IP journey fields, not CCMS, not frontend totals.

Also follow `.cursor/rules/ip-billing-ward-cross-module.mdc`.

## Canonical surfaces

| Surface | Role |
|---|---|
| `/dashboard/billing/opd` (+ create/coding) | Canonical cashier / OPD bill desk |
| `components/billing` (`OpdBillForm`, `PaymentDialog`, `ItemizedBillingDialog`, `GroupedBillItems`) | Canonical bill UI |
| `/dashboard/ip-management/billing` + `CollectPaymentDrawer` | IP **worklist / projection / deep link** into OpdBill |
| Charge mapping / reconciliation / integration-health | Admin billing ops |
| `/admin/billing` | Legacy mock — do not extend as production billing |

Do not build a second bill desk. Pharmacy/optical billing stay in those domains but still must not invent a parallel general ledger.

## Rules

- Never implement financial state solely in the frontend.
- Never silently overwrite financial totals.
- Client-side sums are display-only; persist via billing APIs.
- Coverage may allocate/split **responsibility**; it does not own the cash ledger.
- IP `FinancialState` / `TotalPaid` / `IpBillingTransaction` are workflow projections.
- Prefer `react-hot-toast`. Do not expand sonner usage in billing (`ItemizedBillingDialog` / `PaymentDialog` currently import sonner — do not migrate without approval, and do not add more sonner).
- Failed payment/integration must not render as success.

Charge catalog / service catalog / payer pricing are master data with owners — do not hardcode price lists in the UI.
